{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS经Electron子进程Node模块执行。对应需求：执行。官方：Execution via Electron Child Process Node.js Module。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS经Electron子进程Node模块执行","references":["https://www.matthewslipper.com/2019/09/22/everything-you-wanted-electron-child-process.html","https://www.trustedsec.com/blog/macos-injection-via-third-party-frameworks/","https://nodejs.org/api/child_process.html"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"35330ba2-c859-4c98-8b7f-c19159ea0e58","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type in (\"start\", \"process_started\") and \n process.args == \"-e\" and process.args : \"const*require*child_process*\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS经Electron子进程Node模块执行\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.007","name":"JavaScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/007/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","vers